# 3. Implemented Tool-Wait Semantics

External tool waits are represented at Continuation scope:

```text
C1 ACTIVE
    ↓
C1 WAITING
    ↓ tool result
create C2 ACTIVE child
    ↓
C1 TERMINAL
```

No normative `TOOL_WAIT` Attempt Phase is implemented.

